+      <p class="margin-none-block-start">
+        Upload an export file to create a brand new account with everything in it — boards, cards,
+        comments, files and people. We'll email you when it's done.
+      </p>
+    </div>
+
+    <%= form_with model: @import, url: account_imports_path, method: :post, multipart: true, scope: :import,
